# Product Overview

Sellable SaaS: shared app + shared PostgreSQL + `tenant_id` (ADR 005). Self-service trial; subscription billing.

| Edition        | Buyer     | Roles (this version)                       |
| -------------- | --------- | ------------------------------------------ |
| `personal`     | Collector | `owner`                                    |
| `professional` | Merchant  | `owner` (solo use; no customer logins yet) |

**Next version:** `customer` role for catalog / orders. **Not now:** `staff`, `guest`, `customer`.

**DB:** `POSTGRES_URL` only (ADR 004).

**Locale:** UI language is **`zh-TW` \| `en`**, chosen by the person in the chrome (header or settings) at any time — not a signup field, not a module. Persist on the device (e.g. `localStorage`). Tenant `locale` remains a stored default for first visit / fallback only.

**Domain:** **stock** — `schemas/`, `models/`.

Branch split vs portfolio demo: **ADR 003** / `product-git-workflow.mdc`.
